# Task train_09: every time the robot visits the inspection station B, it
# must from that point stay out of the hazard zone X until it reaches the
# delivery bay C. A C at the B step or later is required for each B; X is
# forbidden strictly between that B and its C, and allowed on the C step.
# Vacuously satisfied if B is never visited.
every(B, avoid_until(X, C))
